       R's x^0 aligns with x^(i-128). R = x^0+x^1+x^2+x^7 (bits 0,1,2,7) plus the x^128
       which cancels bit i.
       Equivalent: xor poly into bits (i-128) ... 
       R_bits at positions 0,1,2,7 relative to the x^(i-128) term, and position 128 cancels.
